<section class="home-feature-square-links home-feature-testimonials">
    <h2 class="main-section-header header-dark-blue">TSC Students</h2>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="image-container" style="background-image: url(/media/content-assets/landing-pages/home-page/Rick-Faezy-Testimonial.jpg);"></div>
                <div class="feature-link" style="background-image: url(/media/content-assets/landing-pages/home-page/Rick-Faezy-Testimonial.jpg);">
                    <div class="link-text">
                        <p>"TSC gave me the opportunity to move away from my hometown, experience a new environment, and become more independent. Along the way, I&rsquo;ve made friendships that I know will last a lifetime while continuing to grow academically."</p>
                        <div class="author">Rick Faezy</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dark-overlay"></div>
                    <div class="home-feature-square-links-reset"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="image-container" style="background-image: url(/media/content-assets/landing-pages/home-page/Jaelyn-Perez-Testimonial.jpg);"></div>
                <div class="feature-link" style="background-image: url(/media/content-assets/landing-pages/home-page/Jaelyn-Perez-Testimonial.jpg);">
                    <div class="link-text">
                        <p>"TSC has given me the opportunity to grow academically and personally. Being involved on campus helped me become more confident in my leadership skills and allowed me to connect with different students and people who have made my college experience."</p>
                        <div class="author">Jaelyn Perez</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dark-overlay"></div>
                    <div class="home-feature-square-links-reset">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section><span id="d.en.46436"></span>
<section class="feature__carousel">
  <div class="container feature__carousel__container">
    <div class="feature__carousel__info">
      <h2>Campus Announcements</h2>
      
    </div>
    <div id="feature__carousel__carousel-46436" class="feature__carousel__carousel"><div class="feature__carousel__item">
  <div class="feature__carousel__item-image" style="background-image: url(/media/content-assets/landing-pages/home-page/Aspen-Announcement-Carousel.jpg);"></div>
  <div class="feature__carousel__item-text">
    <h3>TSC Named Top Ten Aspen Finalist</h3>
    <div>Selected by the Aspen Institute College Excellence Program, TSC is one of just 10 community colleges nationwide competing for the 2027 Aspen Prize. TSC is also the only Florida college to advance to the finalist stage.</div>
    <a href="/about/nationally-recognized-proudly-tsc/" class="main-button button-center">See What Makes Us Top Ten</a>
  </div>
</div><div class="feature__carousel__item">
  <div class="feature__carousel__item-image" style="background-image: url(/media/content-assets/landing-pages/home-page/Pride-and-Prejudice-Homepage-Announcement.jpg);"></div>
  <div class="feature__carousel__item-text">
    <h3>Don't Miss Pride and Prejudice </h3>
    <div>November 12 -22, 2026. TSC students, faculty, and staff receive free admission with a valid TSC ID.</div>
    <a href="/student-life/arts-and-culture/theatre-tsc/" class="main-button button-center">Get Your Tickets Now</a>
  </div>
</div><div class="feature__carousel__item">
  <div class="feature__carousel__item-image" style="background-image: url(/media/content-assets/landing-pages/home-page/Spring-27-Enrollment-Homepage-Announcement.jpg);"></div>
  <div class="feature__carousel__item-text">
    <h3>Spring Classes Open for Enrollment</h3>
    <div>Don't wait for the classes you need to fill up. Enroll for Spring today and build your ideal schedule.</div>
    <a href="/academics/student-records-registrar--admin-needs/how-to-register-for-classes/" class="main-button button-center">Get Help Registering for Spring</a>
  </div>
</div><div class="feature__carousel__item">
  <div class="feature__carousel__item-image" style="background-image: url(/media/content-assets/landing-pages/home-page/Summer-Fall-26-Commencement-.jpg);"></div>
  <div class="feature__carousel__item-text">
    <h3>Summer and Fall Commencement 2026</h3>
    <div>Join us at the Donald L. Tucker Civic Center on Wednesday, December 2, 2026, at 4 p.m. to celebrate our Summer and Fall 2026 graduates.</div>
    <a href="/academics/student-records-registrar--admin-needs/commencement/" class="main-button button-center">Ready for Commencement?</a>
  </div>
</div></div>
    </div>
</section><span id="d.en.34570"></span>
