      </a>
  </h3>
  <p class="article-date">
    November 9, 2026
  </p>
    <p class="article-abstract">
      Theatre TSC invites the community to experience the romance, wit, and drama of Jane Austen&rsquo;s beloved classic, Pride and Prejudice. Adapted and directed by Jessica Cavanagh, this captivating production brings Austen&rsquo;s timeless story to life, transporting audiences into a world of love, laughter, and unexpected twists. 
